WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:07.370
Every once in a while we do this where I tell
you some of the strange things that happen

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:12.509
behind the scenes here at the David Pakman
show and one of the things that we sometimes

00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:16.970
do, it's, it's half funny, but I hesitate
to just call it funny because it's also kind

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:24.900
of concerning and sad is when people cancel
subscriptions for what seem like odd reasons.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.400
And this is my opinion, maybe these are not
odd reasons to cancel a subscription.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:36.640
And sadly as the show audience has grown dramatically
over the last year, the sort of unusual reasons

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.730
for canceling have also grown dramatically.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.660
And I want to give you a couple of examples
today.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:48.809
Last week, as you might recall, I said, Iowa
can't keep going first in the democratic primary.

00:00:48.809 --> 00:00:49.809
It just can't happen.

00:00:49.809 --> 00:00:52.860
And I laid out the first primary shouldn't
be a caucus.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.270
The caucus system maybe should be abandoned
altogether.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:01.030
Iowa demographically is not representative
of the United States nor the democratic party.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:05.860
And yes, the fact that they so bungled things
on Monday night last Monday night also is

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.210
more of a reason for Iowa not to go first.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.720
And I gave this disclaimer, which a lot of
people said, David, that's a dumb disclaimer.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.890
You don't need to do that.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.350
Where I said, Hey guys, I just want to be
clear.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.850
I'm not attacking Iowans here.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:20.100
This is not a personal attack on individuals
who live in Iowa.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.100
Iowans are great people.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:25.409
Uh, as far as I've met, met, you know, a few
dozen of them in my life.

00:01:25.409 --> 00:01:29.990
This is not about people from Iowa, a political
analysis and someone canceled because they

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:32.009
said I was insulting people from Iowa.

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:36.790
In that segment, I got an email that said,
quote David, I'll probably not listen to your

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:37.790
show again.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.049
I was a paying subscriber.

00:01:39.049 --> 00:01:40.240
I'm from Iowa.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:45.200
I saw your video about how undeserving Iowa
is of going first with the caucuses.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.189
Insulting Iowa Democrats is disappointing.

00:01:47.189 --> 00:01:51.850
I've long heard about rural America feeling
insulted by the democratic party and I've

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:56.240
ignored it, but the democratic party in this
state has had a clear openness to progressive

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:00.360
candidates, more so than a then a majority
of the States in the country, I believe they

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:01.360
meant.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:03.509
And you and your audience's willingness to
be little.

00:02:03.509 --> 00:02:09.009
The Democrats in this state, despite our boat
voting for Bernie and Obama is frustrating.

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:13.540
I'll just tune into the young Turks and Sam
Cedar from now on.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.140
Their takes were more measured.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:22.720
This is trouble guys, that someone would watch
that segment and someone who is at least apparently

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:30.450
on our side believe that it was about insulting
Iowans as individuals either didn't understand

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:34.810
the segment or something else is going on
and it is very, very sad.

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:38.069
Another recent one is someone who doesn't
like that.

00:02:38.069 --> 00:02:42.860
I don't think Ford vehicles are that great
even though I don't even remember the last

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:43.860
