00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:49.370
I recently got an email that said, David,
stop bad mouthing Ford vehicles.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:53.380
It happened twice when I was a member on your
bonus shows.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:58.709
I will never subscribe if you bad mouth Ford
again.

00:02:58.709 --> 00:03:03.700
I truly appreciate this viewer support while
I had it, but if I don't even remember what

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:08.680
I said, but if merely saying, I don't think
Ford makes the best cars, which I don't.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.459
I mean I, that's certainly my opinion and
I don't remember exactly what I said.

00:03:12.459 --> 00:03:17.330
If that warrants canceling a subscription
